  "about": "The single list of bound D3D12 and DXGI items (D3D12ComIdiom contract). tools/d3d12gen reads it with the pinned Windows SDK headers and writes src/Lrm.Gpu.D3D12.Interop/D3D12.g.fs and D3D12Methods.g.fs. Interfaces get marker types, IIDs, every vtable slot, a delegate per method and wrappers for the methods each one declares; structs are roots whose field types are bound too; enums are bound when a bound struct or method uses them, or when listed here. opaqueEnums are bound as int32 without members. Regenerate with: dotnet run --project tools/d3d12gen/Lrm.Tools.D3D12Gen -c Release",
